<span style="color:#f00">**Claim :** Quadrilaterals  $ABEL'$  and  $AECK'$  are cyclic.</span>
*Proof :* This is easy to see since, 
    \[\measuredangle ECA = \measuredangle BCA = \measuredangle BRA = \measuredangle L'RA = \measuredangle L'K'A = \measuredangle EK'A\]
    from which it is clear that  $AECK'$  is cyclic. The other is entirely similar. 

